---
manual: art.oval.style_method
lines: [1747, 1747]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  fill red
  nostroke
  @circle = oval 10, 10, 50
end
----------- test code
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(35, 35).first(3), "the oval starts at (10, 10)"

oval("@circle").style(left: 200)
wait_frames

assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(35, 35).first(3), "after style(left: 200) it has moved away"
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(225, 35).first(3), "and is drawn at its new left"
